===Ask Clara why she's here{{subst:void|<!--101070120-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Rivet Town|update|You've had the feeling that someone has gotten to the supplies before you but you didn't think it'd be someone that you were close with.<br />Okay, maybe not that close... but you've at least met her before &mdash; you're technically family to Clara now.<br />So what is cute Clara doing alone (with a robot) in such a dangerous place? You have to get to the bottom of this.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Seele:''' ...Why are you helping the vagrants look for medicine? If they're so great, how could they make a little girl go around running errands for them?
:'''Clara:''' N&mdash;No, it's not like that. I wasn't made to do anything... It's just that, the living conditions for the vagrants aren't great. There's not even a clinic in their camp. So, I wanted to help them out.
:'''Clara:''' Also, not all of them are bad people... everyone just wants to survive.
:'''Seele:''' ...
:'''Clara:''' Miss Seele, did this medicine belong to Miss Natasha? Then... can you give me some? The vagrants' injuries are quite serious.
:'''Seele:''' *sigh* I see. Let's split these painkillers then.
:'''Clara:''' R&mdash;Really? We don't need to ask Miss Natasha first?
:'''Seele:''' If I know Nat, she won't mind. Although this will make it more difficult for us... she'll understand. She always does.
:'''Clara:''' Great, thank you, Miss Seele...
:'''Bronya:''' Are you leaving? This old town is too dangerous. We'll accompany you part of the way.
:'''Clara:''' I&mdash;It's fine, I have Perkins for company. And... I have some more things I need to look for here first.
:'''Bronya:''' Understood. Be careful, though.
----
