===Meet up with Seele and the others{{subst:void|<!--101070121-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Rivet Town|update|You've had the feeling that someone has gotten to the supplies before you but you didn't think it'd be someone that you were close with.<br />Okay, maybe not that close... but you've at least met her before &mdash; you're technically family to Clara now.<br />Seele and Bronya finally end their conversation and approach the two of you just as you are asking Clara about her reason for being here.<br />Perfect timing, now it's time for everyone to figure out what to do next.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Seele)
:'''Seele:''' Metal plates and bandages... rubbing alcohol... painkillers. Great, that's everything.
:'''Seele:''' Let's go report to Natasha in Boulder Town, it won't take long to get back.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Go to the orphanage and search for the supplies{{subst:void|<!--101070114-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Rivet Town|update|You finally find your way through the complex roads of Rivet Town and discover the path to the orphanage. As you make your way uphill, you can see the luxurious mansions that overlook the town, watching its every move each and every day.<br />You see that Seele's expression has turned complex, but what's more confusing is that Bronya seems to be having the same emotions...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Seele:''' Ha... That was it?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, it was three against one.
::'''Seele:''' Nah, I could've taken it on by myself. But still... fighting alongside you two was pretty fun.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It wouldn't have been so easy on your own though.
::'''Seele:''' Please, you don't think I could do it? But still... fighting alongside you two was pretty fun.
:'''Seele:''' Should be all clear now. Let's poke around.
:'''Seele:''' The kids at the orphanage were always getting into scraps when we played out here. If I remember it right, there ought to be some supplies for our cuts and bruises stored in that corner there.
:'''Seele:''' I just hope the monster didn't get to them.
:'''Bronya:''' ...It wasn't my imagination.
:'''Seele:''' Huh? What are you talking about?
:'''Bronya:''' This building, this playground equipment... I've seen it all before.
:'''Seele:''' What!? Come on, the overground and underground have been sealed off from each other for over ten years. It would've been news if a Silvermane Guard had come down here, let alone an Overworld princess.
:'''Seele:''' Wait, unless, before that...
:'''Bronya:''' ...Yes, it's a possibility. That would explain why my memory of it is so blurry.
:'''Bronya:''' Come on, I need to look around a bit more before I can be sure...
----
